    "description": "Dual-thumb slider for selecting a range between two values. 5 variants: state (default, hover, pressed, focus, disabled). Handles take the hover and pressed look; focus rings the handle with shadow/focus/default. Use for min/max filtering where both endpoints matter. Always show the current range values alongside. For single-value selection use Slider.",
